asing I, LLC (“SLI”), partially offset by an increase in revenue from unrelated third-party customers. There were no revenues generated from the Heliogen segment during the three months ended June 30, 2026 or 2025.","context":"Net Revenues","section":"Results of Operations","block":331,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-090073","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-14","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001865506","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1865506/000121390026090073/ea0301301-10q_zeoenergy.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/e19aeaff17ec65d63543f54fcf5f353250e9c954c8977d132e9b983b360702d4.bin","sha256":"e19aeaff17ec65d63543f54fcf5f353250e9c954c8977d132e9b983b360702d4"}},{"id":"766d4ed951eef7f7f144c462ae535cdf9679425057587c23b9d3bcd94cf90429","quote":"Cost of revenues increased by $1.2 million from $7.3 million for the three months ended June 30, 2025 to $8.5 million for the three months ended June 30, 2026, primarily driven by an increase in labor costs in the markets in which we operate and an increase in the cost of materials to conform to domestic content requirements of our customers during the current period. As a percentage of net revenues, cost of revenues increased from 40.2% for the three months ended June 30, 2025 to 52.9% for the three months ended June 30, 2026, reflecting a compression in gross margin year-over-year primarily driven by higher material costs, offset by some improvements to labor and other costs.","context":"Cost of Revenues","section":"Results of Operations","block":333,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001213900-26-090073","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-08-14","reportDate":"2026-06-30","cik":"0001865506","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1865506/000121390026090073/ea0301301-10q_zeoenergy.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/e19aeaff17ec65d63543